{"id":"87435","t":{"th":null,"ro":"BanG Dream!","en":"BanG Dream!","na":"BanG Dream!（バンドリ！）"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx87435-yHlVTP1HFiXH.png","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx87435-yHlVTP1HFiXH.png","color":"#f1e450","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/87435-5sL6SrIBG3K5.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":13,"dur":24,"season":"WINTER","year":2017,"start":"2017-01-21","country":"JP","genres":["Comedy","Drama","Music","Slice of Life"],"score":68,"pop":40870,"studio":"Xebec, Issen","desc":"Kasumi Toyama was enthralled by the stars as a young girl, so when she discovers a trail of star-shaped signs one day after transferring to a new school, she can't help but follow them. They lead her to a shop run by the grandmother of one of her new classmates, and Kasumi finds something that will change her life forever: a star-shaped guitar! And just like that, Kasumi knows that forming a band is her destiny.\n\nOf course, convincing Arisa and her grandmother to sell her the guitar won't be easy, and finding a group of other girls who want to become musicians will be even harder. But when a girl has stars in her eyes and a starbeat in her heart, there's nothing that will stop Kasumi from making her fantasies come true!","descTh":"คาซึมิ โทยามะหลงใหลในดวงดาวตั้งแต่ยังเป็นเด็กสาว ดังนั้นเมื่อเธอค้นพบร่องรอยของสัญลักษณ์รูปดาวในวันหนึ่งหลังจากย้ายไปโรงเรียนใหม่ เธอก็อดไม่ได้ที่จะติดตามพวกเขา พวกเขาพาเธอไปที่ร้านของคุณยายของเพื่อนร่วมชั้นคนใหม่ของเธอ และคาซึมิก็พบบางสิ่งที่จะเปลี่ยนชีวิตเธอไปตลอดกาล นั่นก็คือกีตาร์รูปดาว! และเช่นนั้น คาซึมิก็รู้ดีว่าการก่อตั้งวงดนตรีคือโชคชะตาของเธอ\n\nแน่นอนว่าการโน้มน้าวใจอาริศาและยายให้ขายกีตาร์ให้เธอนั้นไม่ใช่เรื่องง่าย และการหากลุ่มสาวๆ คนอื่นที่อยากเป็นนักดนตรีก็จะยากยิ่งขึ้นไปอีก แต่เมื่อหญิงสาวมีดวงดาวอยู่ในดวงตาและมีดวงดาวอยู่ในใจ ก็ไม่มีอะไรที่จะหยุดยั้งคาซึมิจากการทำให้จินตนาการของเธอเป็นจริงได้!","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":null,"descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"yNMj1ZwB9QY","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/87435","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/33573","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"muse_asia","r":"ASIA","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLwLSw1_eDZl2S8kRjXhccfBL7JnI5dFNO","lang":"en","eps":[["7","y:IQ0JEZPAu1A",1635669212,"~",null,null,{"d":1421,"sk":[[106.5,195.0],[1325.0,1414.1]]}],["8","y:RPYRjc30tw8",1635669212,"~",null,null,{"d":1421,"sk":[[1302.7,1410.2]]}],["9","y:2h4ixMn3Bbg",1635669212,"~",null,null,{"d":1421,"sk":[[38.0,128.6],[1323.9,1414.1]]}],["10","y:ODvuEyVx17Y",1635669212,"~",null,null,{"d":1421,"sk":[[54.5,143.0],[1325.0,1414.1]]}],["11","y:z6Q7eSEZvhU",1635669212,"~",null,null,{"d":1420,"sk":[[68.5,157.0],[1325.0,1414.0]]}],["12","y:2vwollGm0UY",1635669212,"~",null,null,{"d":1421,"sk":[[121.5,210.0],[1325.0,1414.0]]}],["13","y:jg35Z8IJuro",1635669212,"~",null,null,{"d":1421,"sk":[[53.5,143.7]],"fin":1}],["ตอนพิเศษ","y:vMadGLmmVkU",1635669212,"~",null,"14",{"d":1421,"sk":[[105.5,194.0]],"sp":1}],["6","y:JEW6Ysq3JmQ",1607169608,"x",null,null,{"d":1420,"sk":[[145.0,234.0],[1323.9,1414.1]]}],["5","y:fpn7FQ1maCk",1607083211,"x",null,null,{"d":1420,"sk":[[149.5,238.0],[1307.3,1410.2]]}],["4","y:_5udsDah0SQ",1606996810,"x",null,null,{"d":1420,"sk":[[42.5,131.6],[1325.0,1414.1]]}],["3","y:ioNBQWLa6k8",1606910409,"x",null,null,{"d":1420,"sk":[[110.5,199.0],[1310.0,1410.2]]}],["2","y:HE4C2kdbhCc",1606824011,"x",null,null,{"d":1420,"sk":[[63.5,152.0],[1277.1,1366.0]]}],["1","y:P7rFuJi2ZCg",1606737610,"x",null,null,{"d":1440,"sk":[[1345.5,1434.5]]}]]},{"p":"muse_asia","r":"ASIA","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLwLSw1_eDZl0nM69TlvyhM2wJHaPF7gl4","lang":"zh","eps":[["7","y:NNvou921Rw4",1635669212,"~",null,null,{"d":1421,"sk":[[106.5,195.0],[1325.0,1414.1]]}],["8","y:O-yHFp0o1Pg",1635669212,"~",null,null,{"d":1421,"sk":[[1299.9,1410.2]]}],["9","y:Y0MP8xwTems",1635669212,"~",null,null,{"d":1421,"sk":[[38.0,128.6],[1322.8,1414.1]]}],["10","y:Oj